*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_add_to_same_named_fields_separately
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 DEPT-A.
   05 HEADCOUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01 DEPT-B.
   05 HEADCOUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 10.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ADD 1 TO HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-A.
    ADD 2 TO HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-B.
    DISPLAY HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-A.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-A DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "006"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [006] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-B.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING HEADCOUNT OF DEPT-B DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "012"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [012] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

